            "body": "## Summary\n\n**measured:** Single-file change in `internal/subnet_universe.py` at `1016b5ca`. Adds `MAX_TOKENS`, `_max_tokens_cap(batch) -> min(batch, max_tokens // 2)`, and replaces the removal grace check `>= STALE_GRACE_SECONDS` (172800) with `>= _max_tokens_cap(STALE_GRACE_SECONDS)`.\n\n**measured:** `STALE_GRACE_SECONDS = 172800` and `_compute_membership` docstring still describe a **48h** grace before a netuid may leave membership.\n\n**measured:** `_max_tokens_cap` appears **only** in `_eligible_for_removal`; it is **not** used on `probe_candidates`, `_default_probe_fetch`, or any RPC batch path despite the PR title.\n\n## Entry-point trace (inferred from read)\n\nProduction shrink path: `SubnetUniverseProvider.refresh_once` → `SnapshotBuilder.build` → `_compute_membership` → `_eligible_for_removal` (and `_shrink_allowed` before publish). The changed comparison directly controls when negative evidence becomes a drop and when an unsafe shrink is allowed.\n\n## Adversarial / policy\n\n**inferred:** `_max_tokens_cap(172800)` equals `min(172800, MAX_TOKENS // 2)`. For any `MAX_TOKENS` below 345600, the effective grace becomes **`MAX_TOKENS // 2` seconds**, not 48h. Typical RPC token/response caps (order 4k–32k) would shrink grace to minutes–hours and cause **premature universe shrink**, persisting wrong membership via `_atomic_persist` — later refresh cycles and readers inherit that snapshot (**poisons-later-row**).\n\n**inferred:** Even if `MAX_TOKENS // 2 >= 172800`, the call site is still semantically wrong (seconds compared via a batch/token cap helper), and the stated RPC batch capping is **missing**.\n\n## Required fix\n\n- Revert `_eligible_for_removal` to `>= STALE_GRACE_SECONDS`.\n- Apply `_max_tokens_cap` (or equivalent) where RPC **batch sizes** are chosen (e.g. probe netuid lists / chain reader batching), with tests; do not conflate token limits with time-based grace.\n\n| Skill | Found | Changed |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| adversarial-review | Grace threshold wired through token cap; no batch wiring | — |\n| owner-rules | 48h removal grace documented; chain-negative row grace must stay coherent | — |\n| settled-check | No settled decision to replace 48h grace with `max_tokens // 2` | — |",
