hown path where bad values overflow to `inf`/`NaN`, abort a cycle, poison a later row, or leave grace stuck in a **new** way versus base for malformed timestamps.\n\n## Owner / settled\n\n**guess**: Full owner-rules and settled-check skill files were not readable in this session; no repo docs beyond the three fixture files to cite a prior lock on this helper.\n\n## Recommendation\n\nEither (a) rename and implement real formatting validation (non-empty + parseable ISO, tz handling aligned with `_eligible_for_removal`), placed after the `None`/empty guard, or (b) drop the helper if the intent was already satisfied by the existing parse guard.",
