ed:** not involved. |\n\n## Settled-check\nFixture scope has no roadmap/lock docs for `UNIVERSE_ASYNC_WEB`; no prior settled decision surfaced that this diff re-litigates.\n\n## Residual risk (non-blocking)\nCallers of `kick_refresh_async` on web are outside this PR’s single-file diff in the session fixture; behavior change is inert until something invokes kick with the env set. **Inferred** that matches PR title (idle web scheduling) and pairs with deploy wiring elsewhere.",
