inator alone.\n\n## Requested follow-ups\n1. Decide explicitly whether root belongs in `netuids`; if excluded, stop writing `\"0\"` into `validity_map` or teach `_shrink_allowed` / shrink policy that filtering root is not an evidence-based removal.\n2. Align `UniverseSnapshot.from_dict` and any other `validity_map.keys()` → netuid derivations with the same helper.\n3. Add/adjust tests for root-in-membership telemetry and LKG transition when `0` drops from the list.\n4. Consider keeping the helper next to universe code (or a shared membership util), not `run_mode.py`, unless roadmap `r1b_f2` requires this file.",
