s unrelated and couples refresh to council cache module.\n\n**Measured:** Helper has no docstring/types unlike neighboring functions; lazy import inside `_compute_membership` is inconsistent with top-level imports in this file.\n\n## Extremes (adversarial)\n\n| Input | Base | Head |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `validity_map = {\"0\": entry, \"1\": entry}` | `[0, 1]` | `[1]` |\n| `validity_map = {}` | `[]` | `[]` |\n| key `\"0\"` only | `[0]` | `[]` |\n\nNo overflow/NaN path in this diff; failure mode is wrong persisted membership, not float edge cases.\n\n## Skills\n\n| Skill | Found | Changed |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| adversarial-review | Traced validity_map → netuids → snapshot persist → API/pump/coverage consumers; `if int(k)` falsy-zero regression | — |\n| owner-rules | Membership list must retain root for universe alignment; scoring exclusion stays in `snapshot_coverage` (`> 0`) | — |\n| settled-check | No roadmap/docs in fixture; established in code comment + `root_netuid_in_membership` receipt field | — |",
