duction in `refresh_once`.\n\n## Settled check\n\n**measured:** Fixture repo has no roadmap/docs path to settle this; treated as new regression, not a re-litigation.\n\nFix direction (for author): pass the actual audit-trail token count (or add it to `DropEvidence`) into `_token_count_guard`, add coverage, and remove the constant `0`.",
