uild, add that on the writer path without removing the reader early return.\n\n## Owner rules touched\n\n- **Rule 4:** violated if any web caller reaches `refresh_once` with lock available (direct call or future shared path).\n- **Rules 1–3, 5:** no change in this diff.\n\n## Extremes / numeric edges\n\n**Skipped:** diff is control-flow only; no new numeric acceptance paths.",
