e listing for this head only exposes `internal/subnet_universe.py` — regression coverage for reload-with-empty-`netuids`+`degraded` would reduce risk.\n\nNo blocking findings (`never-expires`, `overflow`, `aborts-cycle`, `poisons-later-row`) on this change set.\n\n| Skill | Found | Changed |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| adversarial-review | Reload acceptance traced through `get_snapshot`, `get_netuids`, `get_pump_membership_rows`, and council receipt/admission helpers | — |\n| owner-rules | skipped: owner-rules skill not readable in this session fixture | — |\n| settled-check | skipped: settled-check skill not readable in this session fixture | — |",
