          "toolName": "post_verdict",
          "args": {
            "body": "## Summary\n\nSingle hunk in `ensure_refresh_loop`: drop the unconditional `not is_universe_refresh_writer()` early return; after `_ci_or_test()`, allow the loop when **either** `is_universe_refresh_writer()` **or** `inline_worker_expected()` (import guarded with fallback to writer-only).\n\n## Findings\n\n### P2 — MODIFY — boot wiring may not reach the new guard (**inferred** + **measured** in-repo)\n\n**Measured:** `ensure_background_refresh()` still branches `if is_universe_refresh_writer(): … ensure_refresh_loop()` else `ensure_universe_reader()` (one-shot disk reload). It never calls `ensure_refresh_loop()` on the non-writer path.\n\n**Measured:** This PR only changes the guard inside `ensure_refresh_loop()`; no other files in the diff.\n\n**Inferred:** If production boot uses `ensure_background_refresh()` as the sole entry (typical for universe background setup), enabling `INLINE_WORKER` on web still will **not** start the 300s reload thread unless some other call site invokes `ensure_refresh_loop()` directly (not present in the files available at this head).\n\n**Suggested fix:** In the `else` branch of `ensure_background_refresh()`, when `inline_worker_expected()`, call `get_provider().ensure_refresh_loop()` (and keep `ensure_universe_reader()` for the initial reload). Alternatively document and test the direct caller if one exists outside this fixture slice.\n\n### P3 — control-flow safety (**measured**)\n\n**Measured:** `refresh_once()` still returns early with `reload_from_disk_if_stale()` when `not is_universe_refresh_writer()`, so the new loop on split web does not run `_builder.build()` or `_publish()` — satisfies owner rule 4 (non-owner does not produce).\n\n**Measured:** `inline_worker_expected()` is false when `split_worker_v2_enabled()`; v2 split is unaffected.\n\n**Measured:** `reload_from_disk_if_stale()` rejects payloads without `netuids`, avoiding blanking from empty snapshots (owner rule 1 reader path).\n\nNo new numeric inputs; no never-expires / overflow / abort / poison paths introduced.\n\n## Verdict\n\nMODIFY for the likely missing hook from `ensure_background_refresh()` to `ensure_refresh_loop()` on INLINE_WORKER web; the guard change itself is directionally correct and fail-closed on import errors.",
